# Build output only, and none of it is tracked: the handover zip, its staging
# directory (dist/farend-bundle/) and the cached BepInEx download (dist/cache/).
# make-farend-bundle.sh writes the zip on demand and the far end takes it by
# hand; what a release is measured against is the "testedBuild" record in
# docs/support-matrix.md, not a binary in this directory.
dist/*
